<title>USA: Transcend Services in NY outsourcing deal.</title>
<headline>Transcend Services in NY outsourcing deal.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transcend Services Inc said on Monday it has signed a three year, $2.0 million outsourcing contract for medical transcription services for a New York-based hospital.</p>
<p>Atlanta-based Transcend is a healthcare services company focused on the outsourcing of health information management.</p>
